  (text "Closed loop: C=D => no reset. Open/stuck/grounded loop: mismatch pulses feed RC and hard reset.\nU24 OE and function straps are fixed copper, not GPIO. No host bypass or software mask.\nU27 Ioff limits feed into unpowered main logic; leakage is not zero. No maximum input slew at U27/U25.\nActive TAMP hardware, backup anchor and fresh secure readback remain mandatory; XOR alone is insufficient.\nProbe bridging, matched waveform injection and short glitches are residual risks requiring lab tests.\nPowered/unpowered transitions, input thresholds, reset propagation and backup life NOT qualified."
    (at 195 278 0)
